<title>USA: Belden Inc Q1 net rises.</title>
<headline>Belden Inc Q1 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>ST. LOUIS 1997-04-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Quarter Ended March 31,</p>
<p>						     1997		1996</p>
<p>				(in thousands, except per share data)</p>
<p>	Revenues				$175,974	 $169,275</p>
<p>	Cost of sales			  129,916	  127,863</p>
<p>	Gross profit			    46,058	   41,412</p>
<p>Selling, general and administrative</p>
<p>	  expenses				21,118	   19,738</p>
<p>	Amortization of goodwill		 441		108</p>
<p>	Operating earnings		    24,499	   21,674</p>
<p>	Interest expense			 1,643		983</p>
<p>	Income before income taxes	  22,856	   20,691</p>
<p>	Income taxes			     8,971	    8,121</p>
<p>	Net income				13,885	   12,570</p>
<p>	Average shares outstanding	  26,353	   26,212</p>
<p>	Net income per share		     .53		.48</p>
<p>	     ((Reuters Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
